# train_06: every visit to pickup shelf A must reach at least one of the
# two packing stations B or C at that A step or later (either suffices,
# unbounded). Per the contract, evaluation begins at the trigger step, so
# a B or C co-occurring with the triggering A already satisfies it.
# Vacuously satisfied if A never occurs.
every(A, visit({B, C}))
